    = input[i, j, ..., l, n+y, n+x] ; if 0 <= n+y < M and 0 <= n+x < N,
      padding_value                 ; otherwise.
  ```
  where `d = k[1] - m`, `y = max(-d, 0) - offset`, and `x = max(d, 0) - offset`.

  `offset` is zero except when the alignment of the diagonal is to the right.
  ```
